#: lib/screens/about_screen.dart:305
msgid ""
"School Connect is a third-party application that is compatible with Gibbon, "
"the free and open-source school management platform. It is not an official "
"Gibbon Foundation release and is not affiliated with or endorsed by the "
"Gibbon Foundation."
msgstr ""
"School Connect yra trečiosios šalies programėlė, suderinama su Gibbon — "
